CascadingLocationFilter provides a 3-level progressive disclosure selector (Tỉnh/Thành -> Quận/Huyện -> Phường/Xã) ensuring renters find accurate localized listings across Vietnam.

## Design Rules

1. **Hierarchy**: Choosing a City immediately unlocks District dropdown. Choosing District unlocks Ward dropdown.
2. **Clear & Reset**: Changing a higher level automatically clears and recalculates dependent child levels.
3. **Touch Sizing**: Minimum dropdown touch height is 44px on mobile, with prominent chevron icons and high contrast labels.
4. **Empty State**: Disabled select inputs retain clear placeholders (e.g. "Chọn Quận / Huyện trước").
